<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Senin İçin</title>
<style>
  body {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    height: 100vh;
    background: #0f172a;
    color: white;
    font-family: Arial;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .flower {
    position: relative;
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;
    animation: bloom 2s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .petal {
    position: absolute;
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    background: pink;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .petal:nth-child(1) { top: 0; left: 25px; }
  .petal:nth-child(2) { top: 25px; left: 0; }
  .petal:nth-child(3) { top: 25px; right: 0; }
  .petal:nth-child(4) { bottom: 0; left: 25px; }

  .center {
    position: absolute;
    top: 25px;
    left: 25px;
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    background: yellow;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  @keyframes bloom {
    from { transform: scale(0); }
    to { transform: scale(1); }
  }

  h1 {
    margin-top: 30px;
    font-size: 20px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="flower">
  <div class="petal"></div>
  <div class="petal"></div>
  <div class="petal"></div>
  <div class="petal"></div>
  <div class="center"></div>
</div>

<h1>Sana aldığım çiçekler elbet bir gün solar. Ben sana açmaya devam eden bir tane yaptım. Seni Çok Seviyorum Sevgilim. Nice Senelerimize, Mutlu Yıllar 🌸</h1>

</body>
</html>
